Someone offers you something on the street in Japan? Say this politely 🙅
Polite and final.

Today's phrases:
• けっこうです (kekkou desu) = No thank you
• いかがですか (ikaga desu ka) = Would you like some?
• だいじょうぶです (daijoubu desu) = I'm fine / No need

